 >>[2026-08-24 15:18] taste — block scalars should become a known prose leaf with an exact indentation boundary, not a permissive rest-of-file escape hatch.
 >>[2026-08-24 15:20] verify — header-scoped dialect and sigil-binding lookahead pass 709 seed tests and TypeScript build; committed-source warnings fall from 56 to 53.
 >>[2026-08-24 15:22] implement — added a single-purpose block-scalar parser that reuses ProseChunk, deindents content, and stops before same-depth siblings or enclosing closes.
 >>[2026-08-24 15:23] verify — 712 seed tests and TypeScript build pass; recognizing the 64-use canon form reduces source warnings from 53 to 44.
 >>[2026-08-24 15:25] diagnose — final operator labels were claiming next-line identifiers as fallback modifiers, collapsing the following binding before its colon.
